{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17763","headline":"邵州陪王郎中宴 · 杨巨源","name":"邵州陪王郎中宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西塞无尘多玉筵，貔貅鸳鹭俨相连。\n红茵照水开罇俎，翠幕当云发管弦。\n歌态晓临团扇静，舞容春映薄衫妍。\n鲁儒纵使他时有，不似欢娱及少年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}